---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import me from "../assets/me.jpg";
---

<div class="border border-solid rounded-lg p-6 surface">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-center md:items-start">
        <div class="flex-1 space-y-2">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">Hi, I'm Dustin!</h1>
            <p class="text-lg">
                I'm a senior full stack software engineer from Michigan,
                currently enjoying the time from being <a
                    class="link"
                    href="https://www.mmorpg.com/news/zenimax-online-studios-laid-off-213-employees-and-166-from-zenimax-media-24-of-all-this-weeks-layoffs-2000138461"
                    >laid off</a
                > from Zenimax Online Studios and looking for new opportunities!
            </p>
            <p>
                I love art and music and lately I've been really into
                photography, stories (movies, shows, games, etc. The medium does
                not particularly matter to me), and tennis! I have a lot of
                other interests and love learning about other people's passions,
                so please chat me up about them!
            </p>
        </div>
        <Image
            class="rounded-full size-40 shrink-0 -order-1 xl:order-1"
            loading="eager"
            src={me}
            alt="Me smiling in my snowboarding jacket on a sunny winter day"
        />
    </div>
</div>
